# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the ccbuild test suite.
#
# Ninja's State, Node and DepsLog allocate graph nodes, edges and dependency
# records with `new` and never free them: the ninja binary performs one build
# and exits, so these live for the whole process by design.  ccbuild's tests
# run many builds in one process, which LeakSanitizer reports.  Only
# allocations made inside these Ninja functions are suppressed; leaks in
# ccbuild's own code are still reported.
#
# Usage: LSAN_OPTIONS=suppressions=tests/lsan.supp ctest ...
leak:State::AddEdge
leak:State::AddIn
leak:State::AddOut
leak:State::GetNode
leak:Node::Node
leak:Node::AddOutEdge
leak:DepsLog::Deps::Deps
leak:DepsLog::RecordDeps
leak:DepsLog::Load
leak:ImplicitDepLoader::LoadDepsFromLog
